{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51464","headline":"赠刘郎中 · 李郢","name":"赠刘郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东南秀气动文星，天子应教扫内庭。\n湘渚雪晴弧鹤唳，锦江云尽一峰青。\n仁含楚树花先发，爽照宾「筵」□□□。\n□□定宜端剑佩，上仙风骨紫兰馨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}